@namespace PoPunkouterSoftware.Client
@using PoPunkouterSoftware.Shared
@* One dependency on /diag, as a .po-diag__card: label + status pill, what it is for, the latency, then the
   problem (when there is one) or the detail. *@

<div class="diag-row po-diag__card" data-check="@Check.Name">
    <h3 class="diag-row__name">@Check.Label</h3>
    <span class="po-badge po-badge--@Diag.Tone(Check.Status)">@Check.Status</span>
    <p class="diag-row__purpose">@Check.Purpose</p>
    <p class="diag-row__summary">
        @if (Check.Problem is not null)
        {
            <strong class="diag-row__problem">@Check.Problem</strong>
        }
        else
        {
            @Check.Detail
        }
        <span class="diag-row__meta">@Latency</span>
    </p>
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public DiagCheckDto Check { get; set; } = default!;

    private string Latency => Check.LatencyMs switch
    {
        <= 0 => "no call made",
        < 1 => "under 1 ms",
        var ms => $"{ms:0} ms",
    };
}
